  message: "Materialized from dogfood tranche 05 (F98.A1 / anon-card-004). Mechanism: usage_contexts[].id emits 'usage:' prefix where spec §9.901 documents 'uc:'. Evidence: frozen substrate.json (8/8 ids prefix 'usage') + spec docs/hypergumbo-spec.md:909/923; fresh tracker run reproduces (usage:sha256:20d859135eb74337). Magnitude: 8/8 usage_contexts (0 documented-prefix matches); 🟩-marked spec surface. Blind severity 3/5, reproduced on frozen substrate + fresh run. RELATED_BUT_DISTINCT from parent META INV-kurup (identifier-bearing fields emit non-canonical formats — this is the usage_context id-prefix instance) and WI-sulaz (done — the Starlette UsageContext extractor / producer). Carded separately from F98.A2 (the metadata.methods vs http_method drift) though both are usage_contexts-shape-vs-spec drifts."  # ce8c
